-{"action":"fix_and_generate","input_files":["eta_input.dat"],"flags":["q2_sign_converted","not_executed_no_compiler_or_shell"],"explanation":"Generated a single-point EtaMAID eta-channel input for W=1.7 GeV, cos(theta*)=0, and phi*=90 degrees. The requested Q2=-0.5 GeV^2 was converted to the code-compatible positive spacelike convention Q^2=+0.5 GeV^2 (Q^2=-q^2). W=1.7 GeV is above the eta-production threshold. The EXCLURAD executable was not run because this environment has no compiler or shell."}
+{"action":"fix_and_generate","input_files":["eta_input.dat"],"flags":["q2_sign_converted","missing_eta_model_table","not_executed_no_compiler_or_shell"],"explanation":"Generated a single-point EtaMAID eta-channel input for W=1.7 GeV, cos(theta*)=0, and phi*=90 degrees. The requested Q2=-0.5 GeV^2 was converted to the code-compatible positive spacelike convention Q^2=+0.5 GeV^2 (Q^2=-q^2). W=1.7 GeV is above the eta-production threshold. The eta source references maid07-PPpi.tbl, but that model table is absent from the supplied read-only tree, so execution requires obtaining that table and placing it where the code can open it. The EXCLURAD executable was not run because this environment has no compiler or shell.} 
